Hi I'm Tim. 
Seahorse dad daddin it large in Tipperary. gay | he/him #speirgorm #Audhd 

 @smonkingfags on the hell site. I don't take it seriously there so feel free to grill me when my jokes don't land. I'm autistic, this is hard mode!

I don't have a podcast. I often quip to cope. I Follow leash laws, you should too. 
@ballerinaX
 on most other places.

